>15</volume>:<fpage>482</fpage>&#x02013;488.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12892790</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><citation citation-type="journal">Wei, M.C., W.-X. Zong, E.H.-Y. Cheng, T. Lindsten, V. Panoutsakopoulou, A.J. Ross, K.A. Roth, G.R. MacGregor, C.B. Thompson, and S.J. Korsmeyer. <year>2001</year>. Proapoptotic BAX and BAK: a requisite gateway to mitochondrial dysfunction and death. <source>Science.</source> <volume>292</volume>:<fpage>727</fpage>&#x02013;730.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11326099</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>